            <modifier field="info" type="add" value="The additional Marks of Chaos are only available in the dedicated marine units. For example, Khorne Berzerkers are a Chaos Space Marine unit with the Mark of Khorne. Cult units are found in the Elite options unless that army is led by a commander with the same Mark of Chaos, which places the unit in its original force organization slot." />
