        </rule>
        <rule name="Destroyer" id="f637-5178-ea0b-680e" hidden="false">
          <description>A tank with Destroyer upgrade causes enemy units forced to move due to a tank shock on a 4+ with normal saves allowed.
A Dreadnought with Destroyer upgrade may re-roll one close combat miss in each round of close combat, and when rolling for Fire Frenzy will trigger Blood Rage on a 1 or 2.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
