            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="4a42059d-12cd-4c1f-a4c7-bb569d13eeea">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">2+/5++</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="634c-d453-6494-c756-f9b7f" name="Destroyer Hive" page="0" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Once per game in any assault phase Typhus can use the hive instead of attacking. 
At the start of Typhus's initiative step, place a Large Blast marker over Typhus (doesn't scatter). 
All units suffer a number of hits equal to the number of models from their unit that are at least partially covered by the template.
These hits are S4 AP2 and Ignores Cover. This attack does not affect Typhus.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="22d8-d1b1-b272-f99a-f9b7f" hidden="false" targetId="ae970133-d0be-0936-0b4b-009985e0be18-f9b7f" type="rule">
