    <selectionEntry id="0fc0-f5da-9abb-2498-f9b7f" name="Cult of Destruction" page="123" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="7fc3-dcab-759c-a77e-f9b7f" name="Empyrionic Guidance Rituals" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>At the start of the CSM Movement phase, each Warpsmith in this Formation can perform a set of Empyrionic Guidance Rituals on one unit of Obliterators or Mutilators from the Formation that is within 8". Each Warpsmith must pick a different unit to perform the ritual upon. 

If a unit of Obliterators is selected then it can shoot twice (at the same unit) in the Shooting phase of the turn. If a unit of Mutilators is selected, then it can attack twice after Piling In in the Assault phase of the turn.

Carry out the first set of attacks to completion, then carry out the second set of attacks. A unit must use different weapons for the two different sets of attacks, and canot use a weapon it used in the previous turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="030f-f455-9226-42f6-f9b7f" name="1-3 Warpsmiths" hidden="false" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="eb5a-753e-4172-7790-f9b7f">
