            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer and his unit can re-roll all failed To Hit rolls in close combat when attacking units that contain any models from the Armies of the Imperium. In addition, the bearer and his unit can re-roll all faied To Wound rolls in close combat when attacking units that contain any Ultramarines.</characteristic>
