          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">After depoyment, make D3 rolls on the Combat Drugs table to see what effect the Intoxicating Elixer has on the bearer. All effects are cumulative, including with the Combat Drugs Command Benefit should the bearer be part of a Rapture Battalion.</characteristic>
