            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer of the Endless Grin has the Fear special rule. Enemy units must reduce their Leadership by 1 whilst they are within 6" of the bearer.</characteristic>
