            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Bolts of Ecstatic Vexation can be fired from any boltgun, bolt pistol, or boltgun part of any combi-weapon that the bearer is equipped with; that weapon's profile gains the Blast, Ignores Cover, and Pinning special rules.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules />
